        "name": "Regierungsviertel bounds — task-13 additional 500 m context expansion",
        "description": "An additional metric 500 m outward buffer around the complete task-12 central-Berlin polygon. The bounded task-13 scene adds a second current OSM street and context-building ring in every direction, propagates that exact scope through the 2D overview, 3D prisms and Minecraft voxel pipelines, and preserves every previously mapped civic area.",
